E35B 10A342           (    forth6809.asm):04177                     CMPD  2,U
E35E 27E2             (    forth6809.asm):04178                     BEQ   ALOOP
                      (    forth6809.asm):04179         
E360 AE44             (    forth6809.asm):04180                     LDX   4,U
