E56E DD18             (    forth6809.asm):04542                     STD   MSCR3             ; MSCR3 = bytes to shift
E570 2715             (    forth6809.asm):04543                     BEQ   RPSHIFTDONE
E572 DC18             (    forth6809.asm):04544         RPSHIFT:    LDD   MSCR3
