F2DE 3610             (    forth6809.asm):07192                     PSHU  X                 ; result c-addr
F2E0 3606             (    forth6809.asm):07193                     PSHU  D                 ; result u
F2E2 5D               (    forth6809.asm):07194                     TSTB
F2E3 2707             (    forth6809.asm):07195                     BEQ   SQIEND
